description=v3.5.1 the swipe opens the recents list (read while the finger moves, because this phone's gesture navigation never lets a bottom-edge swipe finish), the power-save governor and its frequency ceilings now decided per cluster - this phone's big cluster was being left out - and the launcher's app list refreshed once on the way out so its drawer is not left grey. RMX3430.
